    "title": "One injured in Dothan shooting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Richard Everett Joseph Sims ,\n3 hours ago DOTHAN, Ala ( WDHN ) — One person was rushed to the hospital after a shooting on Wednesday.\nDothan Police received a call about shots being fired in the 400 block of Donna Drive on Wednesday evening.\nPolice say that when officers arrived on the scene, they found a man with gunshot wounds.\nThe victim was transported to the hospital for treatment. His condition is currently unknown.\nAccording to Dothan Police, there is currently no suspect in custody.\nStay with WDHN for updates.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WDHN - wdhn.com.\n1",
